WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.962
This is where I sit to watch Mommy cook.

2
00:00:06.963 --> 00:00:14.218
I sit on a stool.

3
00:00:14.219 --> 00:00:18.573
This is where I sit to eat.

4
00:00:18.574 --> 00:00:28.065
I sit on a dining room chair.

5
00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:33.528
This is where my baby brother sits to eat.

6
00:00:33.529 --> 00:00:41.592
He sits in a high chair.

7
00:00:41.593 --> 00:00:46.053
This is where I sit to study.

8
00:00:46.054 --> 00:00:54.338
I sit in a desk chair.

9
00:00:54.339 --> 00:00:59.303
This is where I sit to read.

10
00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:07.700
I sit in an easy chair.

11
00:01:07.701 --> 00:01:13.396
This is where I sit to rock my doll.

12
00:01:13.397 --> 00:01:22.186
I sit in a rocking chair.

13
00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:27.036
This is where my brother sits to ride in the car.

14
00:01:27.037 --> 00:01:35.775
He sits in a car seat.

15
00:01:35.776 --> 00:01:40.827
This is where I sit to fish by the lake.

16
00:01:40.828 --> 00:01:57.146
I sit on a folding chair.

17
00:01:57.147 --> 00:02:02.808
What chairs do you sit on?

